  "notes": "USAGE:\n{配役|はいやく} can refer to both the process of casting (assigning roles) and the result (the cast list). In modern usage, the loanword キャスティング (casting) is also common for the process, while {配役|はいやく} is preferred in more formal or traditional contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {配役|はいやく}を{決|き}める (to decide the casting)\n- {配役|はいやく}を{発表|はっぴょう}する (to announce the cast)\n- {配役|はいやく}が{豪華|ごうか}だ (the cast is star-studded)\n- {主役|しゅやく}の{配役|はいやく} (casting of the lead role)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- キャスティング (casting — loanword, more modern)\n- キャスト (cast — loanword)\n- {役柄|やくがら} (type of role; character)",
